          "prompt": "Use this image as reference to create a new variation in the exact same visual style, but replace all text and copy with the following slide content:\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Background: Deep matte obsidian black with tactile Xerox photocopy dither grain texture.\n• Top Navigation: Swiss HUD technical framing with monospace index coordinates and spec numbers.\n• Typography Hierarchy: Monolithic grotesque display typography in crisp inverted white with high-contrast tracking.\n• Color Highlights: Pastel pink and lime highlighter blocks behind key highlighted words\n• Floating Decals: Industrial caution tape strips, barcode badges, and inverted technical spec stamps.\n• Lighting & Finish: High-contrast raking rim light, deep lifted shadows, 35mm analog film grain, tactile physical texture.\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 MISSION: SCROLL-STOPPING VISUAL HERO PIECE] ===\n• Objective: Stop the scroll instantly within 1.5 seconds with a breathtaking, high-aesthetic visual masterpiece.\n• Visual Architecture: Dominant central composition, massive bold stacked typography with vibrant highlighter bars, and playful floating 3D micro-stickers (cherries 🍒, disco ball 🪩, lightning ⚡, cash 💸, pixel mouse cursor 🖱️).\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"COMMERCE FUNNEL\" with a small pink dot\nMain Headline: \"how to turn 1 simple comment into sales while you sleep.\" (Render in massive bold stacked editorial serif with tight leading)\nHighlighter Words: Put a soft pastel pink highlighter bar behind words: \"sales while you sleep, automated dm\"\nSubtitle / Description: \"You do not need to beg people to click the link in bio. Set up this automated DM robot in 2 minutes.\"\nSpeech Bubble Stickers: \"Autopilot Sales\" (green), \"2-Min Setup\" (pink)\nBottom Swipe Prompt: \"THE BIO LINK TRAP →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (10